      "question": "<a href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/bitwise-and-of-numbers-range\" target=\"_blank\">Bitwise AND of Numbers Range</a>",
      "number": 6,
      "hint": null,
      "notes": "",
      "explanation": "Find the common prefix of binary representations of m and n. Right shift both numbers until they are equal, then left shift by the count of shifts. This gives the common bits that remain 1 in the AND of all numbers in range.\nTime complexity: O(log n), Space complexity: O(1)\nAlgorithms: Bit Manipulation\nData Structures: Integer\nKey concepts: Binary representation, Common prefix, Bit shifting",
